    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Important Notes\n\n- Insulation thickness values are based on insulation with thermal resistivity in the range **4 - 4.6 ft² hr °F/Btu in** (typical for mineral wool at room temperature)\n- **Conversion:** 1 inch = 25.4 mm\n- Always insulate pipe work in heating systems to avoid heat loss and reduced system efficiency\n- Hot water and steam systems must be insulated to prevent personal injuries from very hot surfaces\n- These recommendations apply to nominal pipe sizes (NPS) as indicated"
